              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Souter asked whether the limiting phrase \u201cwith respect to the stock\u201d is the key threshold condition in the statute."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "809007d149a746f9f598accce4594fbea5a12f26e91860225ac4f0c0bf2971b0",
